# library-data/ is Git-tracked source data: one JSON per record plus the asset binaries
# (model.glb / texture.png / thumbnail.png / .bbmodel). They are small — tens of KB per asset —
# and reviewing them as part of a commit is the point.
#
# Only the transient sides stay out: AI deliveries that have not been approved, and anything the
# tool can regenerate from a record.
library-data/asset-production/*/incoming/
library-data/asset-production/*/rejected/
